<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <section style="padding: 4rem 5%; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;" data-aos="fade-up">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem;">Privacy and Personal Data Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: #555;">In compliance with Colombian Law 1581 of 2012 and Decree 1377 of 2013, Corporación Matías Restrepo, based in Guarne, Antioquia, informs users of the following personal data policy.</p>
    <h2>1. Purpose of data collection</h2>
    <p style="color: #555;">Personal data collected through our contact and volunteer forms is used only to respond to inquiries, process volunteer applications and share information about foundation activities.</p>
    <h2>2. Rights of data subjects</h2>
    <p style="color: #555;">You may request access, correction or deletion of your personal information by emailing <strong>corporacionmatiasrestrepo@gmail.com</strong>.</p>
    <h2>3. Information security</h2>
    <p style="color: #555;">The organization applies technical and administrative safeguards to protect personal information against unauthorized access, loss or alteration.</p>
    <p style="color: #888; font-size: 0.9rem;">Last updated: November 2026.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
